        <mxCell id="how-to-read" value="&lt;b&gt;How to read · live-smoke-tested 2026-11-16&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 Browser ↔ backend · 2 Responses API ↔ agent · 3 native MCP retrieval ↔ knowledge base · 4 knowledge base ↔ index.&lt;br&gt;Responses return along the same route. Corpus quality, diagram fidelity and private source download access remain separate acceptance checks." style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;dashed=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFDF5;strokeColor=#C8A400;fontSize=14;fontColor=#605E5C;fontFamily=Segoe UI;align=left;spacingLeft=16;spacingRight=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="980" width="1820" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
